105
00:04:54,377 --> 00:04:56,337
(RISAS)

106
00:05:05,263 --> 00:05:08,933
"Anidación, es el abrumador deseo,
durante el embarazo, de asear, organizar

107
00:05:09,017 --> 00:05:11,019
